# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite by default — zero setup, no server to install.
# The path is resolved relative to prisma/schema.prisma, so with the default
# below your data lives in <project root>/db/custom.db (already gitignored).
# Point it anywhere writable to relocate.

DATABASE_URL="file:../db/custom.db"

# ── Platform credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing needed here. Accounts are connected inside the app (Accounts →
# Connect): each platform's credentials are verified live against the real
# API and stored server-side in your database — never in env files, never
# returned to the browser.

# ── AI keys (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keys are managed in-app under Settings → AI providers and stored in the
# database. The vars below do nothing on their own — they're only a hook if
# you extend src/lib/ai.ts with server-side fallback keys yourself.

# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""
# OPENAI_API_KEY=""
# PUBLIHQ_API_KEY=""
